      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.27 (up from ₹3.37 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹7.08b (up 20% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹165.7m (up ₹2.21b from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.3% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was primarily driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 29% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
